# Legacy AFFr GUI Codebase

The legacy AFFr GUI code is the previous version of the application that this
repo is rewriting. It is useful as a reference for behavior, data formats, and
domain quirks that may not be fully captured in the spec.

Its location varies by machine/OS, so paths are recorded per-OS below.

## Paths

- **Windows**: _not yet recorded — ask the user when needed_
- **macOS**: _not yet recorded — ask the user when needed_
- **Linux**: _not yet recorded — ask the user when needed_

When the user reveals the legacy GUI path on a new OS, update the matching
entry above. If the path contains non-ASCII segments (e.g. a Google Drive
`マイドライブ` mount), follow the same wildcard-resolution approach used for
the product spec path.
